    m_Alignment: 4
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Yak\u0131ndan hilal darbesi veya uzaktan delici m\u0131zrak.\nSilah\u0131n
    ve yeteneklerin \xFC\xE7 g\xF6rev boyunca korunur.\n\nTemel sald\u0131r\u0131
    otomatik \xB7 Q silaha \xF6zel \xB7 E isabetlerle dolar\nHer se\xE7im yeni bir
    yetenek ya da davran\u0131\u015F a\xE7ar.\nBa\u015Flang\u0131\xE7ta iki se\xE7enek
    vard\u0131r; s\u0131ralar\u0131 tohuma g\xF6re de\u011Fi\u015Fir."
